# JEWEL 2.6.0 simple-medium parameters: AuAu 200 GeV, 0-10% central.
# Every parameter medium-simple.f reads is set here explicitly. 2.6.0 changed
# the built-in defaults to 5 TeV values (TI 0.59, MDSCALEFAC 1), so nothing
# should be left implicit. The nucleus (A=197) comes from MASS in the main
# params file; medium-simple.f has no "A" key.
CENTRMIN 0.
CENTRMAX 10.
# Initial time [fm] and initial temperature [GeV] at the centre of a central
# collision. TI is the main quenching knob. 0.375 GeV is the value used for
# the genesis production. For reference, the pre-2.6 JEWEL RHIC setting
# (TAUI 0.6, TI 0.36) Bjorken-scales to TI ~0.41 at TAUI 0.4.
TAUI 0.4
TI 0.375
TC 0.17
# Inelastic NN cross section [fm^2]: 4.2 fm^2 = 42 mb at 200 GeV.
SIGMANN 4.2
WOODSSAXON T
NF 3
# Debye mass m_D = max(MDSCALEFAC * 3T, MDFACTOR)
MDFACTOR 0.45
MDSCALEFAC 1.
